<p> Siemens AG		Germany     $61	    $1.92</p>
<p> Matsushita Electric</p>
<p>  Industrial Co. Ltd.  Japan	 $59	   -$495 million</p>
<p> Fiat SpA		  Italy	 $57	    $1.5</p>
<p> Nissan Motor Co. Ltd. Japan	 $53	   -$769 million</p>
<p> Unilever Group	  U.K.	  $50	    $2.42</p>
<p> Veba AG		   Germany     $48	    $1.58</p>
<p> Toshiba Corp.	   Japan	 $46	    $786 million</p>
<p> Texaco Inc.	     U.S.	  $46	    $2.02</p>
<p> DuPont &amp; Co.	    U.S.	  $45	    $3.64</p>
<p> Chevron Corp.	   U.S.	  $44	    $2.61</p>
<p> Nestle SA		 Switzerland $42	    $2.16</p>
